{{also|लागि|लिंग|लौंग|लग्|लुंगी}}
==Hindi==

===Etymology===
Inherited from {{inh|hi|inc-ohi|लोग}}, from {{der|hi|psu|𑀮𑁄𑀕}}, from {{der|hi|sa|लोक}}. 

Use as a plural marker in some dialects is probably generalization of {{m|hi|हम लोग||us}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{hi-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|hi|oːɡ}}

Log plural in hindi is loga

